"zh-Hant"],[["非常不滿意時間上的調配！已經觀察一陣子開店時間都不一定，好不容易等到今天有開店在20分抵達，店家跟我說不收客，我詢問請問你們是8:30不收客嗎？回我25分不收客；我實在很無語。有一陣子在營業時間到都是沒有原因的不開店，但是Google顯示都有營業，終於等到開業了，我在時間內到又跟我說不收客，兩碗拉麵坐在那邊吃，其實不會很久大概10到15分之內會吃完，你們9點營業結束相信可以在你們營業結束前用餐完畢，並且你們也有時間可以收拾我們吃完的餐具。是真心誠意很喜歡你們家拉麵的味道，但是在營業時間跟收客時間這件事情上能不能有所調整？",null,[0,263]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14388461945833670930/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPUjJNelFrUk9SM0J0V1ZWR05WWXdWVE5SYTFwSVlsVmFhMUZWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14388461945833670930/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPUjJNelFrUk9SM0J0V1ZWR05WWXdWVE5SYTFwSVlsVmFhMUZWUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/14388461945833670930/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPUjJNelFrUk9SM0J0V1ZWR05WWXdWVE5SYTFwSVlsVmFhMUZWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14388461945833670930/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPUjJNelFrUk9SM0J0V1ZWR05WWXdWVE5SYTFwSVlsVmFhMUZWUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14388461945833670930/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPUjJNelFrUk9SM0J0V1ZWR05WWXdWVE5SYTFwSVlsVmFhMUZWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14388461945833670930/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPUjJNelFrUk9SM0J0V1ZWR05WWXdWVE5SYTFwSVlsVmFhMUZWUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,994,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOR2MzQkROR3BtWVVGNVYwVTNRa1pIYlVaa1FVRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x5026f292c6dc60b9!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkNGc3BDNGpmYUF5V0U3QkZHbUZkQUE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOR2MzQkROR3BtWVVGNVYwVTNRa1pIYlVaa1FVRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOR2MzQkROR3BtWVVGNVYwVTNRa1pIYlVaa1FVRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOR2MzQk